# Hoarding Dragon (a flier): on entering, Bot1 accepts and searches their own library for an artifact card (a Mountain is
# refused; Sol Ring is found; Bot2's Sol Ring
# stays in Bot2's library, which is not shuffled); it is exiled, not put in hand, and Bot1's library is shuffled. When Terror
# kills the Dragon, its dies ability puts the exiled card into its owner's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hoarding Dragon
Terror
Sol Ring
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Sol Ring
Island x19

